@startuml
title US11 - Register a Parameter\nSystem Sequence Diagram (SSD)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #334155
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UKLabsMS" as System

Admin -> System : The Administrator asks to register a Parameter

System --> Admin : The system requests the Parameter ID, name,\ndescription, and metric

Admin -> System : The Administrator provides the requested information

System --> Admin : The system requests the metric classification\n(Numeric or Qualitative)

Admin -> System : The Administrator selects the metric classification

opt Numeric metric
    System --> Admin : The system requests the minimum and maximum\nreference values
    Admin -> System : The Administrator provides both reference values
end

System --> Admin : The system registers the Parameter and informs\nthe Administrator that the operation succeeded

@enduml